app: error: flags --to-file and --to-url are mutually exclusive
  from: --to-file: environment variable TOOL_TO_FILE

Usage:
  app [flags]

Flags:
      --to-file=STRING  [env: TOOL_TO_FILE] [xor: --to-url]
      --to-url=STRING   [env: TOOL_TO_URL] [xor: --to-file]
      --help            Show help
      --version         Show version
